768
01:03:04,572 --> 01:03:09,160
If you had to choose one...

769
01:03:11,120 --> 01:03:12,538
Only one...

770
01:03:17,043 --> 01:03:18,669
Careful!

771
01:03:29,764 --> 01:03:35,728
You remember the meteorite, 1991 EV?

772
01:03:35,853 --> 01:03:40,483
